    source: https://www.dsmz.de/microorganisms/medium/pdf/DSMZ_Medium221.pdf
    notes: DSMZ221 adds25mLof filter-sterilized20%Na-malate after medium sterilization.
      Nominal20% is source-explicit, but its basis, solvent, sodium stoichiometry
      and stereochemistry are not. The frozen ingredient1316 use is bound to this
      preparation context; its L-specific database annotation is not accepted as the
      component identity. Existing ferric malate stock is a different named solute
      and pure sodium/disodium malate owners are not this stock. Issues811/868 and
      all original chemical-owner holds remain. No exact whole-preparation identity
      is established by inspected named chemical/catalogue owners. Registry scope
      denotes the preparation, not a pure solute or a fully characterized formulation.
